OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm rowing the Indian Ocean in   
OL,4,Amemory of my son'                      
OL,6,FAfter rowing the Atlantic Ocean with   
OL,7,Fthree other men on an epic 3,000-mile  
OL,8,F(4,828km) journey for charity, Rod     
OL,9,FAdlington vowed never to do it again.  
OL,11,FHowever, the turkey farmer from        
OL,12,FSolihull will once again be taking to  
OL,13,Fthe waves in May 2028.                 
OL,15,FThis time, Adlington will be braving   
OL,16,Fthe Indian Ocean, rowing with three    
OL,17,Fothers from Geraldton in Western       
OL,18,FAustralia to Grand Baie in Mauritius   
OL,19,Fwith no support boat.                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
