OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm rowing the Indian Ocean in   
OL,4,Amemory of my son'                      
OL,6,FTheir epic journey is for charity in   
OL,7,Fmemory of his son Barney, who died of  
OL,8,Fmeningitis in 2005 when he was just    
OL,9,Fthree years old.                       
